{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"sunshi-e-p050c","title":"孙策母及诸将请释于吉孙策斩之众人仍祀","accounts":[{"id":"sunshi-e-p050c-account","label":"《江表传》","text":"孙策母及诸将请释于吉孙策斩之众人仍祀","evidence":["sunshi-e-p050c-q"]},{"id":"sunshi-a-p051-judgment","label":"裴松之按《交广二州春秋》","text":"裴松之据王范《交广二州春秋》说建安六年张津仍为交州牧，认同《志林》对孙策以张津死为戒的时间质疑。","evidence":["sunshi-q-p051-judgment"]},{"id":"sunshi-a-p053-judgment","label":"裴松之按语","text":"裴松之明确《江表传》《搜神记》记于吉事不同，未详孰是。","evidence":["sunshi-q-p053-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0018","role":"请救","evidence":["sunshi-e-p050c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"拒救斩人","evidence":["sunshi-e-p050c-q"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0084","role":"被杀","evidence":["sunshi-e-p050c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"孙策据江东时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["sunshi-e-p050c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"sunshi-e-p050c-q","source_order":[46,279,"P050c"],"order":8136}],"persons":[{"id":"sunshi-p0084","name":"于吉","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0018","name":"孙权母（本篇未具名）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"sunshi-e-p050c-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-565f76597180bfb73158","layer":"pei","quote":"诸事之者，悉使妇女入见策母，请救之。母谓策曰：‘于先生亦助军作福，医护将士，不可杀之。’策曰：‘此子妖妄，能幻惑众心；远使诸将不复相顾君臣之礼，尽委策，下楼拜之：不可不除也！’诸将复连名，通白事，陈乞之。策曰：‘昔南阳张津为交州刺史，舍前圣典训，废汉家法律；尝著绛帕头，鼓琴烧香，读邪俗道书；云以助化，卒为南夷所杀。此甚无益，诸君但未悟耳。今此子已在鬼箓，勿复费纸笔也！’即催斩之，悬首于市。诸事之者，尚不谓其死，而云‘尸解’焉，复祭祀求福。","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9299c159b0512c392271","start":128,"end":349,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p051-judgment","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-1dbec06207d56e1b433c","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：太康八年，广州大中正王范，上《交广二州春秋》，建安六年，张津犹为交州牧。《江表传》之虚，如《志林》所云。","attribution":"裴松之按《交广二州春秋》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9299c159b0512c392271","start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p053-judgment","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-f7c8baff138d5729d319","layer":"pei","quote":"按《江表传》、《搜神记》于吉事不同，未详孰是。","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9299c159b0512c392271","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
